  "title": "Perplexity Unveils Groundbreaking AI Assistant for Android Amidst Rising Competition",
  "summary": "Perplexity has taken a bold step forward in the AI race by launching its advanced AI assistant on Android devices. With features like multimodal capabilities and real-world camera integration, this move positions Perplexity as a formidable competitor against tech giants like Google. Backed by NVIDIA and holding a $9 billion valuation, Perplexity's Android-only launch indicates strategic market positioning while awaiting necessary iOS permissions. This development coincides with fresh offerings from OpenAI, intensifying the competition in AI search technology.",
